lue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and July to August and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025, August to September came in at 39% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 44% and March to April at 149% on the middle of the grids. Grid 22357 had its driest year in 1976 at 60%.</p>"}
